sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client as Manager
    participant Ctrl as MaintenanceController
    participant Service as MaintenanceService
    participant StaffSvc as StaffService
    participant DB as Database

    note right of Client: POST /maintenance/assignments (Bearer Token)
    Client->>Ctrl: AssignIssueDto
    activate Ctrl
    Ctrl->>Ctrl: AuthGuard & RolesGuard (Manager only)

    Ctrl->>Service: assignIssue(managerAccountId, issueId, maintainerStaffId)
    activate Service

    Service->>StaffSvc: findByAccountId(managerAccountId)
    StaffSvc-->>Service: StaffInfo

    alt Manager profile not found
        Service-->>Client: 403 Forbidden
    end

    Service->>DB: Find IssueReport (issueId)
    DB-->>Service: IssueReport

    alt Issue not found
        Service-->>Client: 404 Not Found
    end

    Service->>DB: Check existing IssueAssignment
    DB-->>Service: IssueAssignment / null

    alt Already assigned
        Service-->>Ctrl: Existing IssueAssignment
    else New assignment
        Service->>DB: INSERT IssueAssignments
        DB-->>Service: IssueAssignment
    end

    Service-->>Ctrl: IssueAssignment
    deactivate Service

    Ctrl-->>Client: 201 Created
    deactivate Ctrl
